@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

participant "command:SummaryCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":ModelManager" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant ":WatchDog" as Book MODEL_COLOR

Command -> Model : getDogsEnrolledOn(today)
Model -> Book : getEnrolmentList()
Book --> Model : enrolments
note over Model
  Collects distinct dog IDs from
  enrolments whose date equals today.
end note
Model -> Book : getDogList()
Book --> Model : dogs
note over Model
  Selects dogs with those IDs,
  preserving the full list's order.
end note
Model --> Command : enrolledDogs

legend bottom
  Model query used by summary; other summary counts are omitted.
  Returns an unmodifiable snapshot without changing filters or records.
endlegend
@enduml
